## Commands

```bash
npm run validate        # Validate all components against schemas (run before every commit)
npm run build           # Build runtime package (default)
npm run build:reference # Build reference package (exports only, for cross-domain usage)
npm run build:runtime   # Explicitly build runtime package
npm test                # Structure/validation smoke test of the package (NOT the e2e suite)
npm run sync-schema     # Sync schema version from dependencies
```

For security review, use the security audit workflow in this repository or ask for a security review of the current domain. For a runtime-cost audit run `/vnext-ai-toolkit:domain-check`; for a problem that is the runtime's, not this domain's, run `/vnext-ai-toolkit:report-issue`.

